    narr:narration """This hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus. Recent developments from late August 2026 demonstrate the operationalization of this strategy. The team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_1), marking a concrete step in the product's evolution. This release was supported by the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_3), which is framed as the technical unlock for the current workflow. Performance metrics from the same period indicate a [peak in team velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_2), suggesting that the integration and the new widget have positively influenced the development rhythm.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787922766540_1> ;
